y5-compositor (1.4.0-1ubuntu2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Quilt source with offline Cargo/npm vendoring and bundled rustc sysroot.
  * Always compile on Launchpad (no prebuilt stage in the source tarball).
  * Drop duplicate y5.compositor.dev; session wrapper moved to libexec.
  * Depends on polkitd and xdg-desktop-portal-gtk; drop MESA_DEBUG.

